OL,3,ADid a goat herder's lucky $200 nugget
OL,4,Aspark a gold rush in western Kenya?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA goat herder from a remote area of
OL,7,Fwestern Kenya has told the BBC his
OL,8,Fdiscovery of a golden nugget has
OL,9,Fsparked a gold rush, overwhelming his
OL,10,Fsmall village over the last few weeks.
OL,12,FWhen people found out that 33-year-old
OL,13,FManasse Lomachar had sold his three
OL,14,Fgrams of gold for 36,000 Kenyan
OL,15,Fshillings ($280; #205) several weeks
OL,16,Fago, he believes this led to the
OL,17,Farrival of thousands of prospectors in
OL,18,FCheporor.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
