OL,3,ADid a goat herder's lucky $200 nugget
OL,4,Aspark a gold rush in western Kenya?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd it is true that what last month was
OL,7,Fjust bushland and rough grazing ground
OL,8,Fnear the village is now scarred by
OL,9,Fpits, mounds of earth and makeshift
OL,10,Fmining camps.
OL,12,FIt is not clear if was Lomachar's lucky
OL,13,Ffind or other recent discoveries that
OL,14,Fsparked the excitement. But local
OL,15,Fauthorities estimate that about 10,000
OL,16,Fpeople arrived at the height of the
OL,17,Frush.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
